  "descriptions": [
    {
      "description": "This component houses forthcoming work, active development notes, research roadmap materials, and planned publication surfaces associated with Dimensional Human Field Theory (DHFT), Structural Stability Science (SSS), the Structural Identification Method (SIM), Load\u2013Capacity\u2013Boundary Mechanics (LCB), and Somatic Rising Institute (SRI).\n\nMaterials in this component identify areas of active scientific development, planned technical notes, domain records, public briefings, educational materials, Spanish-language materials, deployment records, and institutional work in progress.\n\nRecords listed here are not final source records unless separately filed, DOI-assigned, or identified as published. Forthcoming-work materials do not replace, modify, or expand the foundational DHFT source architecture and do not authorize assessment, audit, certification, training, institutional deployment, machine use, practitioner use, teacher training, professional implementation, curriculum licensing, or derivative method development.\n\nAll authorized use requires written authorization through Somatic Rising Institute or the source steward.",
      "descriptionType": "Abstract"
    }
  ],
